{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Designed and built by a team of veterans from Activision, WB Games, Crytek, Epic and Guerilla Games, ANIMO Stars Arena is a videogame that blends adorable animal pilots with ridiculously powerful mech juggernauts. Fight in epic multiplayer battles that will keep you constantly tinkering with your loadouts and hangar of fully customized war machines!<br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2323240/extras/ANIMO_Stars_Arena_-_Front_page.png?t=1747938852\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>CUSTOMIZE YOUR MECH</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Each ANIMO is composed of a: Cabin, Engine, Bumper, and 2 weapons!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Customize your own mech war machines and wreak havoc in multiple battlescapes. Choose traversal engines spanning treads, hovercraft, spider legs, wheels and more, and pair them with dozens of cabins and bumpers. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Then finish off your personalized mech with a host of special weapons like grappling hooks, flamethrower, sniper rifle, lasers, and more to manifest your own incredibly cute and powerful mechs of annihilation!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2323240/extras/Mech_chicken_v01a.png?t=1747938852\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2323240/extras/ANIMO_11Kit_v01a.521.png?t=1747938852\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>PAINT YOUR ANIMO!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Choose from a variety of paint themes and skins for your mech!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2323240/extras/Paint_themes.png?t=1747938852\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>CHOOSE YOUR PILOT!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Your pilot represents who you are. Choose your favorite pilot whether that\u2019s a cute cuddly puppy, a fierce bird, or a slithering snake!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2323240/extras/Pilots_-_Lined_up.png?t=1747938852\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2323240/extras/ANIMO_-_Pilots_lined_up.png?t=1747938852\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>PLAY YOUR FAVORITE GAME MODE!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Jump on board your ANIMO and battle other players across different game modes including team deathmatch, battle royale, capture the flag and more!  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2323240/extras/ezgif.com-crop__13_.gif?t=1747938852\" />  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2323240?t=1747938852","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2323240/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1747938852","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2323240/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1747938852","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2323240/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1747938852","categories":[{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Online PvP","id":36},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","demos":[{"appid":2611930,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Designed and built by a team of veterans from Activision, WB Games, Crytek, Epic and Guerilla Games, ANIMO Stars Arena is a videogame that blends adorable animal pilots with ridiculou